Clean-Room Provenance Statement
================================================================================

Dry is an independent, clean-room implementation authored from specification and
first principles. FullControl (GPLv3, https://github.com/FullControlXYZ/fullcontrol)
is used solely as:
(a) Architectural inspiration for the multi-level dialect design, and
(b) A dev/CI-time behavioural test oracle generating expected outputs for regression gates.

No source code from FullControl is copied into Dry. FullControl is quarantined under
`conformance/oracle/` and is NOT shipped, linked into, or included in any Dry release
artifact. See docs/CLEANROOM.md.
